DTSTAMP:20261114T061449Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261121T083000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261121T173000
SUMMARY:911 Memorial Trail Washington DC
DESCRIPTION:Metrotrails: NJ\, PA\, NY Metropolitan Area Hiking and More!\n
 Join us for this point to point hike\, the next in our series on the 911 N
 ational Memorial Trail!\nThis Saturday hike will be the one that will star
 t from near the Pentagon and bring us along the southern of two routes tho
 ugh Washington DC (the other route will be subject of the Sunday hike).\nW
 e will meet at the Old Port of Bladensburg Park at Baltimore Avenue in Bla
 densburg MD\, and then shuttle with as few cars as possible to our start p
 oint near the Pentagon.\nThe route will take us by the Pentagon and the 91
 1 Memorial there\, and then north and across the Potomac River through the
  south side of the National Mall. From there\, we follow streets south for
  just a bit to the Anacostia River.\nQuite simply\, the remainder of the h
 ike follows the Anacostia River Greenway to our end point\, with beautiful
  scenery\, a mix of suburbia and woods as we reach where the river is smal
 ler in Maryland!\nIf needed\, contact me at 908 343 8374
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/metrotrails/events/317216778/
