SUMMARY:Washington DC 911 Trail Hike
DESCRIPTION:Metrotrails: NJ\, PA\, NY Metropolitan Area Hiking and More!\n
 Join us for this second point to point hike of the weekend\, this time cov
 ering the second of the two 911 Memorial Trail routes from DC into Marylan
 d!\nAfter meeting\, we'll shuttle with as few cars as possible\, or maybe 
 take the train\, to our start point near the capital. We'll hike the Capit
 al Mall\, then head north along the trolley trail route\, cut east through
  a grassy linear park\, followed by Anacostia River Greenway to our end po
 int!\nDistance will be about 15 miles and easy terrain.\nIf needed\, conta
 ct me at 908 343 8374
